## Package.resolved is not tracked in this collection (SwiftRepositorio has no
## package dependencies today, but the convention holds).
Package.resolved

## xcframework build pipeline
##
## .cache/  — pinned upstream sources (git clones at exact commits, the OpenSSL
##            release tarball). Reproducible from scripts/versions.sh; never
##            committed.
## build/   — per-slice cmake/ninja trees and install prefixes. Intermediate.
## artifacts/ — the finished Clibgit2.xcframework, ~40 MB of static archive.
##            Not committed: a binary blob in git is exactly the architecture
##            this package exists to avoid. It is produced by
##            scripts/build-xcframework.sh and, for downstream consumers, is to
##            be published as a release asset and referenced by url + checksum.
.cache/
build/
artifacts/

## macOS
.DS_Store
